# An unknown address under the documentation gets the English page-not-found
# page, with status 404. The folder de/ has a rule of its own for the German
# page. This rule replaces the one of the company website inside this folder.
# The address is the one the page register (src/site.ts) gives the page;
# scripts/check-head.mjs compares the two.
ErrorDocument 404 /deltarecon/docs/en/page-not-found/
